\par\par \b \uc2 Peru's Stock Indexes End Higher; Sol Stronger   \b0\par\par\uc2 330 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Oktober 2007\par 22:43\par \uc2 Dow Jones Capital Markets Report\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--Peru's main stock indexes ended higher Wednesday, boosted by stronger metals prices.   \par \par \uc2 According to preliminary results, the stock market's broad general index gained 142.47 points, or 0.65%, to end at 22,177.13.   \par \par \uc2 The selective blue-chip index ended 346.9 points, or 0.91%, higher at 38,551.85.   \par \par \uc2 "Investors were encouraged by metals prices and they are expecting positive earnings reports. This is fueling interest," one trader said.   \par \par \uc2 Southern Copper Corp.\uc2  (PCU) gained 5.0% to $135.50 on higher copper prices and when a strike ended at the company's three Peruvian units.   \par \par \uc2 Workers went on strike Oct. 2 to back demands for higher wages and other benefits. They agreed to lift the strike as of the first shift Wednesday after an agreement was signed late Tuesday.   \par \par \uc2 The company said that its production was not affected by the strike.   \par \par \uc2 Copper miner Sociedad Minera Cerro Verde SAA (CVERDEC1.VL) rose 1.54% to end at $29.60.   \par \par \uc2 Zinc miner Compania Minera Volcan SAA (VOLB.VL) rose 0.70% to end at 14.35 soles ($4.76).   \par \par \uc2 The sol ended Wednesday at a midrate of PEN3.0155 to the dollar on a spread of PEN3.0150-PEN3.0160.   \par \par \uc2 The sol is expected to gain over the next few sessions as companies seek the national \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  for a monthly tax payment.   \par \par \uc2 The sol ended the previous session at a midrate of PEN3.0190 to the dollar on a spread of PEN3.0180-PEN3.0200.   \par \par \uc2 The Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  Wednesday in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to purchase $110 million.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly in recent sessions, aiming to smooth out movements in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and to build foreign reserves.   \par \par \uc2 Despite the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the sol has continued to strengthen.   \par \par \uc2 -By Rebecca Howard, Dow Jones Newswires; 51-1-221 7050; peru@dowjones.com [ 10-10-07 1643ET ]   \par \par \uc2 1071 1837   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020071010e3aa000gz\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
