\par\par \b \uc2 Peru's Main Stock Indexes End Higher; Sol Strengthens   \b0\par\par\uc2 297 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 Oktober 2007\par 22:29\par \uc2 Dow Jones Capital Markets Report\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--Peru's main stock indexes ended higher Monday, boosted by strength on Wall Street and by higher mineral prices.   \par \par \uc2 According to preliminary results, the Lima Stock Exchange's general index rose 134.98 points, or 0.62%, to end at 21,958.42.   \par \par \uc2 The selective blue-chip index increased 133.03 points, or 0.35%, to finish at 37,844.71.   \par \par \uc2 Copper miner  \uc2 Southern Copper Corp.\uc2  (PCU) rose 3.6% to end at $129.00, on stronger copper prices, while copper miner Sociedad Minera Cerro Verde SAA (CVERDEC1.VL) increased 1.3% to end at $29.20.   \par \par \uc2 Financial holding company  \uc2 Credicorp Ltd.\uc2  (BAP) continued to rise, gaining 3.6% to end at $67.70.   \par \par \uc2 The Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  Monday in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to purchase $260 million.   \par \par \uc2 A \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  official said this was the largest single-day \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on record, and came about on strong demand for the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from foreign and institutional investors.   \par \par \uc2 Despite the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the sol continued to strengthen.   \par \par \uc2 The sol ended at a midrate of PEN3.0580 to the U.S. dollar on a spread of PEN3.0570 to PEN3.0590.   \par \par \uc2 The sol ended the previous session at a midrate of PEN3.0625 to the U.S. dollar on a spread of PEN3.0400 to PEN3.0850.   \par \par \uc2 Scotiabank noted in a report late Friday that \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to purchase some $6.77 billion so far this year, 58% higher than all the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  carried out last year.   \par \par \uc2 The sol has been gaining on strong exports, remittances and investments, among other factors.   \par \par \uc2 -By Robert Kozak, Dow Jones Newswires; 51-1-221 7050; peru@dowjones.com   \par \par \uc2 [ 10-01-07 1629ET ]   \par \par \uc2 1071 1837   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020071001e3a1000er\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
