change\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and to build foreign reserves.   \par \par \uc2 -By Rebecca Howard, Dow Jones Newswires; 51-1-221 7050; peru@dowjones.com [ 07-23-07 1648ET ]   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020070723e37n000io\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
