\par\par \b \uc2 Peru's Main Stock Indexes End At Record High Levels   \b0\par\par\uc2 365 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Juli 2007\par 22:16\par \uc2 Dow Jones Capital Markets Report\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--Peru's main stock indexes ended at record high levels on Thursday, as a wide range of blue-chip shares gained ground on strong optimism about the economy and corporate earnings.   \par \par \uc2 According to preliminary results, the general index gained 283.88 points, or 1.24%, to end at 23,211.65.   \par \par \uc2 The selective blue-chip index ended 514.70 points, or 1.28%, higher at 40,686.44.   \par \par \uc2 The local stock market was boosted by hopes of strong second-quarter corporate financial results.   \par \par \uc2 Shares were also lifted by strength on Wall Street, one trader said.   \par \par \uc2 Precious metals miner  \uc2 Compania de Minas Buenaventura\uc2  SAA (BVN) gained 1.5% to end at 126.50 soles ($40.03) on stronger gold prices.   \par \par \uc2 Southern Copper Corp.\uc2  (PCU) rose 2.4% to $108.20 due to early strength in copper prices.   \par \par \uc2 Copper miner Sociedad Minera Cerro Verde SAA (CVERDEC1.VL) also gained, jumping 3.4% to $27.20.   \par \par \uc2 Blue-chip financial holding company  \uc2 Credicorp Ltd.\uc2  (BAP) climbed 3.8% to $64.00.   \par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the sol ended slightly weaker at a midrate of 3.1595 soles to the U.S. dollar on a spread of PEN3.1590 to PEN3.1600.   \par \par \uc2 The sol had ended the previous session at a midrate of 3.1590 soles to the U.S. dollar on a spread of PEN3.1580 to PEN3.1600.   \par \par \uc2 The Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  Thursday in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to purchase $120 million.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly this year to buy dollars to ease movements in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and to build foreign reserves.   \par \par \uc2 Market analysts say that there has been strong demand in the last few trading sessions for the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  tied in part to corporate tax payments and payments for special worker bonuses.   \par \par \uc2 Some demand from foreigners also has been noted.   \par \par \uc2 Banco de Credito said in a report that \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy dollars so far this year has totaled more than in full-year 2006.   \par \par \uc2 -By Robert Kozak and Rebecca Howard, Dow Jones Newswires; 51-1-221-7050; peru@dowjones.com [ 07-12-07 1639ET ]   \par \par \uc2 1071 1837   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020070712e37c0007v\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
