\par\par \b \uc2 Peru's Main Stock Indexes End Higher; Sol Unchanged   \b0\par\par\uc2 274 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Juli 2007\par 22:42\par \uc2 Dow Jones Capital Markets Report\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--Peru's stock indexes ended higher Monday when investors were once again encouraged by rising metals prices.   \par \par \uc2 According to preliminary results, the general index rose 242.27 points, or 1.08%, to end at 22,608.17.   \par \par \uc2 The selective blue-chip index ended 543.62 points, or 1.38%, higher at 39,857.75.   \par \par \uc2 Rising gold prices boosted precious metals miner  \uc2 Compania de Minas Buenaventura\uc2  SAA (BVN) 5.2% to 123.00 soles ($38.80).   \par \par \uc2 Zinc miner Compania Minera Volcan SAA (VOLB.VL) rose 1.2% to end at PEN16.55 on stronger zinc prices and expectations about the company's second quarter earnings.   \par \par \uc2 Copper miner Sociedad Minera Cerro Verde SAA (CVERDEC1.VL) gained 0.46% to end at $26.12.   \par \par \uc2 Investors also showed keen interest in Empresa Siderurgica del Peru SAA, or  \uc2 Siderperu\uc2  (SIDERC1). The share rose 8.2% to PEN3.05.   \par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the sol ended unchanged Monday at a midrate of PEN3.1675 to the U.S. dollar on a spread of PEN3.1670 to PEN3.1680.   \par \par \uc2 "In the short term we expect that the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  will remain around PEN3.17 per dollar, and we don't rule out the participation of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market," Scotiabank said in a report.   \par \par \uc2 The Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Monday to purchase $1 million.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and the stock market were closed Friday for a national holiday.