\par\par \b \uc2 Peru's Main Stock Indexes End Higher; Sol Weakens   \b0\par\par\uc2 292 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Juni 2007\par 22:45\par \uc2 Dow Jones Capital Markets Report\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--Peru's main stock indexes ended higher Tuesday, continuing with their strong rebound after falling sharply last week.   \par \par \uc2 According to preliminary results, the stock market's broad general index rose 427.49 points, or 2.04%, to end at 21,340.54.   \par \par \uc2 The selective blue-chip index ended 791.80 points or 2.18% higher at 37,151.72.   \par \par \uc2 "Last week we had a significant correction and this week investors have taken a buying position. The fundamentals of the economy and the companies are solid," a trader said.   \par \par \uc2 The general index fell 7.59% last Wednesday but has gained every day since then.   \par \par \uc2 On Tuesday, a wide range of mining company shares gained ground.   \par \par \uc2 Copper miner Sociedad Minera Cerro Verde SAA (CVERDEC1.VL) rose 4.1% to end at $25.50.   \par \par \uc2 Precious metals miner  \uc2 Compania de Minas Buenaventura\uc2  SAA (BVN) gained 0.9% to end at 107.95 soles ($34.05).   \par \par \uc2 Zinc miner Compania Minera Volcan SAA (VOLB.VL) rose 3.9% to end at PEN14.80.   \par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the sol ended slightly weaker at a midrate of PEN3.1705 to the U.S. dollar on a spread of PEN3.1700 to PEN3.1710.   \par \par \uc2 The sol ended the previous session at a midrate of PEN3.1695 to the U.S. dollar on a spread of PEN3.1690 to PEN3.1710.   \par \par \uc2 The Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to purchase $35 million.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly in recent sessions to buy dollars to ease movements in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and to build foreign reserves.   \par \par \uc2 -By Robert Kozak and Rebecca Howard, Dow Jones Newswires; 51-1-221 7050 [ 06-05-07 1645ET ]   \par \par \uc2 1071 1837   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020070605e3650009h\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
