\par\par \b \uc2 Peru's Broad General Stock Index Ends 7.59% Lower   \b0\par\par\uc2 By Robert Kozak and Rebecca Howard   \par \uc2 Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES   \par \uc2 551 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Mai 2007\par 22:18\par \uc2 Dow Jones Capital Markets Report\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--Peru's stock market, one of the best performers in the world so far this year, tumbled sharply Wednesday as nervous investors pulled out their money.   \par \par \uc2 The main stock indexes were dragged down on heavy trading volume by weakness in mining company shares and to a lesser extent by an earlier slide in stocks in China.   \par \par \uc2 The decline was so sharp that the stock market halted trading for half an hour late in the morning.   \par \par \uc2 After declining more than 10% at one point in the session, the stock market's broad general index rebounded a bit to end 1,522.95 points lower, or 7.59%, at 18,543.82.   \par \par \uc2 The selective blue-chip index fell 2,673.28 points, or 7.67%, to end at 32,171.76.   \par \par \uc2 "This is herd behavior," said Jorge Luis Rodriquez, with brokerage Centura SAB.   \par \par \uc2 "One detonator is that the media has been predicting this fall and this has had an impact," he added. "This is one of the biggest falls in the history of the stock exchange."   \par \par \uc2 Market analysts said that many individual investors, who have piled into the stock market following a 168% increase in the general index last year, decided to sell their shares and their mutual fund holdings.   \par \par \uc2 "The main factor was internal. It was investors selling their mutual funds, which have had to sell the shares," Gonzalo de la Casas, with private pension fund AFP Integra, said on CPN radio.   \par \par \uc2 Finance Minister Luis Carranza downplayed the sharp declines, saying Peru's economic fundamentals remain solid.   \par \par \uc2 Carranza told reporters that the stock market has been affected by speculative behavior.   \par \par \uc2 "These are speculative movements and aren't affecting the nation's economic fundamentals. We have to be confident that in the long term that business conditions, which sustain dividend payments and the fundamental value of shares, are going to continue to remain very positive," he said.   \par \par \uc2 Chinese stocks tumbled after the government tripled a tax on securities transactions. That affected confidence in the Lima stock market as well.   \par \par \uc2 Only two stocks rose Wednesday, including  \uc2 Southern Copper Corp.\uc2  (PCU), which gained 0.5% to end at $86.45.   \par \par \uc2 Among the many shares that dropped, copper miner Sociedad Minera Cerro Verde SAA (CVERDEC1.VL) plunged 10.1% to end at $19.79.   \par \par \uc2 Financial holding company  \uc2 Credicorp Ltd.\uc2  (BAP) fell 3.4% to end at $56.35.   \par \par \uc2 At the end of trading Wednesday, the general index was up some 44% so far this year from 12,884.20 at the end of last year. But the index is down some 24% from a record high of 22,995.09 reached on May 9.   \par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the sol ended unchanged at a midrate of PEN3.1750 to the U.S. dollar on a spread of PEN3.1740 to PEN3.1760.   \par \par \uc2 The Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Wednesday to purchase $21 million.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly in recent sessions to buy dollars to ease movements in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and to build foreign reserves.   \par \par \uc2 -By Robert Kozak and Rebecca Howard, Dow Jones Newswires; 51-1-221-7050; peru@dowjones.com [ 05-30-07 1652ET ]   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020070530e35u0008e\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
