\par\par \b \uc2 Peru's Main Stock Indexes Gain; Sol Weakens   \b0\par\par\uc2 296 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 18 Mai 2007\par 22:47\par \uc2 Dow Jones Capital Markets Report\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--Peru's main stock indexes gained strength Friday when higher metals prices sparked investor interest.   \par \par \uc2 According to preliminary results, the stock market's broad general index gained 497.69 points, or 2.32%, to end at 21,971.16.   \par \par \uc2 The selective blue-chip index ended 919.94 points, or 2.48%, higher at 38,038.79.   \par \par \uc2 The stock market's general index rose Friday for the first time since May 9, when it hit a record high 22,995.09 points.   \par \par \uc2 "Today the market is rebounding after the loss in recent sessions. Improving metals prices also helped investor enthusiasm," a market analyst said.   \par \par \uc2 Zinc miner Compania Minera Volcan SAA (VOLB.VL) gained 3.4% to 16.95 soles ($5.37) in heavy trading.   \par \par \uc2 "The zinc prices improved slightly and the response was very positive," the analyst said.   \par \par \uc2 Higher copper prices also helped boost copper miner Sociedad Minera Cerro Verde SAA (CVERDEC1.VL) 3.3% to $26.95.   \par \par \uc2 Tin miner Minsur SAA (MINSURI1.VL) also fared well, gaining 2.1% to end at PEN11.05.   \par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the sol ended slightly weaker Friday at a midrate of PEN3.1625 to the U.S. dollar on a spread of PEN3.1600 to PEN3.1650.   \par \par \uc2 The sol ended the previous session at a midrate of PEN3.1610 to the U.S. dollar on a spread of PEN3.1600 to PEN3.1620.   \par \par \uc2 The Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to purchase $240 million.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly in recent sessions to buy dollars to ease movements in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and to build foreign reserves.   \par \par \uc2 -By Rebecca Howard, Dow Jones Newswires; 51-1-221 7050 [ 05-18-07 1647ET ]   \par \par \uc2 1071 1837   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020070518e35i0007t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
