\par\par \b \uc2 Peru's Main Stock Indexes Continue To Decline; Sol Unchanged   \b0\par\par\uc2 308 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Mai 2007\par 22:36\par \uc2 Dow Jones Capital Markets Report\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 LIMA (Dow Jones)--Peru's main stock indexes ended sharply lower Wednesday as a group of red-hot mining company shares cooled.   \par \par \uc2 According to preliminary results, the stock market's broad general index fell 615.67 points, or 2.78%, to end at 21,556.22.   \par \par \uc2 The selective blue-chip index ended 930.39 points, or 2.43%, lower at 37,394.43.   \par \par \uc2 The stock market's general index has now fallen every day since May 9, when it hit a record high 22,995.09 points.   \par \par \uc2 "There are corrections that are natural in the market. There isn't anything that shows a change in fundamentals right now," said one trader.   \par \par \uc2 Weaker copper and zinc prices helped dragged down base metals miners on Wednesday.   \par \par \uc2 Southern Copper Corp.\uc2  (PCU) fell 1.6% to end at $85.13, while copper miner Sociedad Minera Cerro Verde SAA(CVERDEC1.VL) lost 2.7% at end at $26.75.   \par \par \uc2 Zinc miner Compania Minera Volcan SAA (VOLB.VL) lost 1.2% to end at 16.50 soles.   \par \par \uc2 Precious metals miner  \uc2 Compania de Minas Buenaventura\uc2  SAA, (BVN) dropped 0.2% to end at PEN101.91 on weaker gold prices.   \par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the sol ended unchanged at a midrate of PEN3.1640 to the dollar on a spread of PEN3.1630 to PEN3.1650.   \par \par \uc2 The Central Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Peru intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to purchase $85 million.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly in recent sessions to buy dollars to ease movements in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and to build foreign reserves.   \par \par \uc2 A market analyst said that demand for soles during the session continued to be strong.   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  Tuesday to purchase $125 million.   \par \par \uc2 -By Robert Kozak, Dow Jones Newswires; 51-1-221 7050 [ 05-16-07 1636ET ]   \par \par \uc2 1071 1837   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020070516e35g0008i\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
